uzzi parking and landscaped garden. It is designed for total privacy and comfortable modern living.\n\nThe villa features a semi open plan living dining and kitchen area. The living room opens directly onto a large terrace which creates a strong indoor outdoor flow. The master bedroom includes a private terrace and the home offers fitted wardrobes walk in showers and beautiful mountain views. Every space is designed to feel open bright and functional.\n\nThe lower level adds exceptional lifestyle space. It includes a cinema room gym pool table area and laundry room. Outside there ‌is ‌a ‌fully ‌fitted ‌kitchen ‌BBQ and ‌bar area ‌ideal for entertaining. This villa ‌is ‌a ‌strong ‌luxury ‌investment and a perfect ‌family ‌home ‌in ‌a ‌prime ‌Marbella ‌location."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Puerto","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Sur","Excelente","Privada","Aire Acondicionado","Calefacción Central.","Chimenea","Montaña","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Gimnasio","Sala de Juegos","Lavadero","Suelos de Mármol","Jacuzzi","Barbacoa","Sótano","Privado","Persianas Eléctricas","Privado","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Port","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South","Excellent","Private","Air Conditioning","Central Heating","Fireplace","Mountain","Garden","Pool","Covered Terrace","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","Gym","Games Room","Utility Room","Marble Flooring","Jacuzzi","Barbeque","Basement","Private","Electric Blinds","Private","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available","gps":{},"energia":{"CO2Rated":"","CO2Value":"","EnergyRated":"","EnergyValue":"","Image":""},"gastos":{"comunidad":"0","ibi":"0","basura":"0"}}